• Evaluate crew availability, qualifications, and readiness to determine appropriate mission assignments &nbsp;

• Exercise independent judgment in resolving complex scheduling conflicts, irregular operations, and resource constraints &nbsp;

• Serve as a central point of coordination for flight operations, partnering with pilots, AROs, and cross-functional teams &nbsp;

